{"id": "P-00", "version": 1, "type": "purpose", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "owner": "AU-zach", "text": "Help Zach conceive, discover, construct, understand, evaluate and improve Commander decks; the ontology makes possibilities discoverable, the evaluator makes consequences intelligible, the tools make both usable. The repository is infrastructure for the Magic project"}
{"id": "P-01", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "One semantic authority per question: Oracle and the rules govern mechanical truth, the DIO governs its representation, unverified grammar/KB output stays a candidate", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio-addendum@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio-a1a7@1"}]}
{"id": "P-02", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Rules-relevant distinctions (object and event identity, timing, costs, permissions, state transitions) survive Oracle -> grammar -> DIO contract -> KB -> evaluator", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio-a1a7@1"}]}
{"id": "P-03", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Every claim carries its evidence and its verification state", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}]}
{"id": "P-04", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Discovery is not evaluation: the interaction layer describes, evaluators judge; do not equate connectivity with card quality (DIO)", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}]}
{"id": "P-05", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Recommendations that can be acted on respect the real collection", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}]}
{"id": "P-06", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Decision provenance is append-only", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}]}
{"id": "P-07", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Validation modes stay separate", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}]}
{"id": "P-08", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Criteria are versioned and revisable; an approved revision is a supersession, not drift", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}]}
{"id": "P-09", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "mtg-purpose", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "The DIO is a governed source: pinned, revised only by a dio_revision decision, impact-checked on revision, and its parsimony rules bind this repo's governance (proposed, D-0020)", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P-00@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio-addendum@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio-a1a7@1"}]}
{"id": "D-0011", "version": 1, "type": "decision", "subject": "mtg-design", "status": "accepted", "decided_by": "AU-zach", "text": "Copy effects and impulse draw in role classification: a generic copy effect does not fill the role of what it might copy; copy is handled ontologically (a copy takes on the copied object's behaviour)", "relations": [{"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}]}
{"id": "D-0016", "version": 1, "type": "decision", "subject": "mtg-design", "status": "proposed", "decided_by": null, "text": "Route construction requests by kind; docs/DOCUMENT_PRECEDENCE.md is the source-precedence rule; DIO v3.1.1 with its addendum and A1-A7 governs representation; Protocol references to DIO v2.x are read as v3.1.1", "relations": [{"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio-addendum@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio-a1a7@1"}]}
{"id": "D-0020", "version": 1, "type": "decision", "subject": "mtg-design", "status": "proposed", "decided_by": null, "text": "P-09: the DIO is a governed source (pinned in .aec/records.jsonl, revised only by a dio_revision decision, impact-checked), and its parsimony rules bind this repo's governance", "relations": [{"rel": "depends_on", "to": "P-09@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}]}
{"id": "D-0021", "version": 1, "type": "decision", "subject": "mtg-design", "status": "proposed", "decided_by": null, "text": "Adopt the AEC v0.3 records slice for the DIO (.aec/records.jsonl, scenarios), pin AEC upstream at a commit and run aec check in CI; keep decisions/ as the decision log and mirror only DIO-dependent decisions", "relations": [{"rel": "depends_on", "to": "P-09@1"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "P-06@1"}]}
