{"id": "D-0020", "version": 2, "type": "decision", "subject": "mtg-design", "status": "accepted", "decided_by": "AU-zach", "text": "P-09: the DIO is a governed source (pinned in .aec/records.jsonl, revised only by a dio_revision decision, impact-checked), and its parsimony rules bind this repo's governance. Accepted by Zach 2026-11-01", "relations": [{"rel": "depends_on", "to": "P-09@2"}, {"rel": "depends_on", "to": "SRC-dio@1"}, {"rel": "supersedes", "to": "D-0020@1"}]}
